 now be following you.","What this does.\n1. gets the current gps coords from a nmea gps.\n2. updates the home position on the map. (note does not update home on the MAV)\n\nHow to use it\n1. connect to ap.\n2. open this and pick your comport, and baud rate for your nmea gps.\n3. it should now be updating home.":"What this does.\n1. gets the current gps coords from a nmea gps.\n2. sends a guided mode WP to the AP every 2 seconds.\n\nHow to use it\n1. connect to ap.\n2. take off, test guided mode is working.\n3. open this and pick your comport, and baud rate for your nmea gps.\n4. it should now be following you.","Write":"WPs speichern","Write Flash":"Flash speichern","Write Params":"Parameter speichern","Yaw 2 roll":"P","You cannot load new firmware while connected via MAVLink. \n\nPlease press the Disconnect button at top right to end the current MAVLink session and enable the firmware loading screen.":"MAVlink Verbindung aktiv. Es kann keine Firmware geladen werden. Verbindung \"Trennen\" wählen, danach kann Firmware installiert werden.","You only need to use this if you are having issue with your OSD not updating":"Option nur nötig, falls OSD nicht richtig aktualisiert.","Youtube Example":"Beispiel auf Youtube","Zero":"Min","Zero Altitude Warning":"Warnung vor Nullhöhe","Zoom":"Vergrössern","Zoom To":"Hierhin zoomen"}}